# Google OAuth (Web client)
# Create at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# Authorized JavaScript origins: http://localhost:5173  (+ your Vercel URL)
# Authorized redirect URIs: http://localhost:5173/google-callback.html  (+ production /google-callback.html)
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Show “Paylo” on Google’s “Choose an account” screen (not the Vercel domain):
# 1. Google Cloud Console → Google Auth Platform → Branding
# 2. App name: Paylo
# 3. Upload app logo, set support email, homepage, privacy policy URLs
# 4. Add authorized domain (e.g. paylobycaps.vercel.app or your custom domain)
# 5. Submit Brand verification — until verified, Google only shows the redirect domain
